      "content": {
        "eyebrow": "Dashboards that stay right",
        "title": "Stop rebuilding broken dashboards after every change",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Rename a field or adjust a metric and Charts marks each chart it touches inside that very pull request, so dashboards never fail silently after a merge and nobody learns about it from an annoyed colleague."
        ],
        "primary": {
          "label": "See how it works",
          "href": "/resources/webinars/charts-as-code"
        },
        "media": {
          "assetRole": "product.screenshot",
          "alt": "Weekly active teams metric with a trend chart",
          "ref": "/assets/pages/tabs/dark-7.svg"
        }
